{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important:</strong> Tape Us Out is a fully online cooperative experience. To play, two players are required, each with their own copy of the game and a  a way to communicate with\u00a0one\u00a0another.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/acf2b578464f266184af26c2d432367a.poster.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/acf2b578464f266184af26c2d432367a.webm?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all begins when two friends, passionate about antiques, stumble upon a garage sale. Curious, they explore the place in search of relics until they come across a box full of VHS tapes. Among familiar and worn-out titles, one tape stands out: <i>Tape Us Out</i> \u2014 a name neither of them had ever heard before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/01c4f5b6efa51f3c17ca7a9efdfd294b.poster.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/01c4f5b6efa51f3c17ca7a9efdfd294b.webm?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/01c4f5b6efa51f3c17ca7a9efdfd294b.mp4?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excited, they decide to have a surprise movie session that afternoon. Little did they know that by pressing play, they were about to dive into something far beyond a simple film\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/a281953e0ab9debe54f213188cb776ec.poster.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/a281953e0ab9debe54f213188cb776ec.webm?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/a281953e0ab9debe54f213188cb776ec.mp4?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the blink of an eye, the two are pulled into the TV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now trapped, they must journey through worlds inspired by different cinematic genres: from epic high-fantasy adventures, to the tension of a crime thriller where every second counts to defuse a bomb, and even the horror of being hunted by a monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/c94addf555b247627b3441d8ff7522ee.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=518 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>List of Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players, each with their own unique perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandatory online cooperative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments based on six films from distinct genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive narrative with a nostalgic VHS-inspired aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on communication and coordination between players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maps, hints, or in-game tutorials \u2014 everything depends on cooperation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/68ec2a4bcadc3eae91fbfe5ae561b93e.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no maps. No hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have is each other\u2019s mind \u2014 and your voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget: the only way out is by working together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.poster.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.webm?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.mp4?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661830?t=1773095458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/38bf4ca254bc9c05e00c7600bba75cc2b9483f6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773095458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/38469d3b4607ed01227f906e9f8f5d9119a58b23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773095458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.