nique perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandatory online cooperative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments based on six films from distinct genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive narrative with a nostalgic VHS-inspired aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on communication and coordination between players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maps, hints, or in-game tutorials \u2014 everything depends on cooperation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/68ec2a4bcadc3eae91fbfe5ae561b93e.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no maps. No hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have is each other\u2019s mind \u2014 and your voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget: the only way out is by working together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.poster.avif?t=1773095458\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.webm?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661830/extras/0047db52c01f31704528d045a9806bb6.mp4?t=1773095458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Graveyard Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id